# Synthetic Sports Civilization / Rendered Window Architecture
**Status:** Canonical Pantheon Architecture  
**Aliases:** AI Sports League, Synthetic League, Rendered Window, Faster-Than-Render Simulation  
**Domain:** Multi-agent simulation, sports, persistent worlds, generative media, economics, agent societies  
**Date:** 2026-09-20
