WORLD >> WINDOW

The world may contain far more information than any observer can consume.

A viewer receives:

Window(
    world,
    observer,
    intent,
    perspective,
    bandwidth
)

This operator generalizes beyond sports to:

* synthetic civilizations,
* tactical simulations,
* digital twins,
* ecological modeling,
* economic simulations,
* historical simulations,
* training environments,
* games,
* education,
* autonomous-agent societies.

